  lines:
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Maaan, how long could it possibly take to piss? I wanna continue playing
      \talready!"
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: 'Patience bro, you know Marc has that thingie with her bladder. '
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "Yeah yeah. Still annoying waiting for her to come back to play. At least
      Jerkley isn\u2019t here today. Break's a lot more peaceful without him. I don\u2019t
      even have to worry about my console getting trashed and can actually play without
      looking over my shoulders. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Oh yeah true. You got a clue why he\u2019s not here today? Not that I'm
      complaining, of course. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 0
    kind: 0
    text: "I don\u2019t know the details but apparently he messed with the wrong
      person, and his parents told him to come home immediately so they could properly
      apologize to the kid. "
    videoEventId: 
  - speaker: 1
    kind: 0
    text: "Aahh, gotcha. Hey, if I were a lesser man I\u2019d suggest taking this
      as an opportunity to make a mess off his dorm room. I heard he always keeps
      a spare key in his locker for his friends. "
    videoEventId: 
